; Behaviour block: a white walker near the ceiling (kind 2, rooms 22 and 23)
;
; Used by the patrollers at the top of rooms 22 and 23 (attribute $47, 20 pixels tall; seen hanging near the ceiling in room 22).
; .
; Layout: see #R$93D3.
@label=BehaviourWhiteFlyer
b$940A DEFB $00,$01,$0A,$06,$02  ; hit box top, left, bottom, right; slot +$15 (Unknown)
 $940F DEFB $47      ; attribute
 $9410 DEFW $AC9F    ; table of (first column, width) for x AND 3
 $9412 DEFB $0C      ; sprite height (2-pixel units)
 $9413 DEFW $9417    ; sprites, first direction (left or up)
 $9415 DEFW $941B    ; sprites, second direction (right or down)
 $9417 DEFW $D78F    ; first direction, frame 0
 $9419 DEFW $D79A    ; first direction, frame 1
 $941B DEFW $D7A5    ; second direction, frame 0
 $941D DEFW $D7B0    ; second direction, frame 1
